b. health;  
c. education;  
d. manpower;  
e. population and civil registration:f. law;  
g. women's empowerment and child protection;  
h. cooperatives and Micro, Small and Medium Enterprises;  
i. mental and spiritual matters; andj. peace and order.  
2. The prevention of acts of violence by Regional Apparatus as referred to in paragraph (1), shall be carried out in an integrated and sustainable manner based on the Regional Long-Term Development Plan and the Regional Medium-Term Development Plan.

